      "text": "POST /send-email — clé API\n1. apiKeyMiddleware : clé → user\n    → config SMTP liée à la clé\n2. Idempotency-Key (rejeu / 409)\n3. Zod + rendu du template {{var}}\n4. chiffre to, text, html (AES-GCM)\n5. log pending + contenu → D1\n6. Queue.send({ emailId }) → 202",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ar-send",
      "originalText": "POST /send-email — clé API\n1. apiKeyMiddleware : clé → user\n    → config SMTP liée à la clé\n2. Idempotency-Key (rejeu / 409)\n3. Zod + rendu du template {{var}}\n4. chiffre to, text, html (AES-GCM)\n5. log pending + contenu → D1\n6. Queue.send({ emailId }) → 202",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
